dosbox-x Borland-Clipper-Microsoft
==================================


USEFUL LINKS
------------

* https://winworldpc.com/
* https://archive.org


INSTALLATION
------------

You can install dosbox-x by means of

    sudo apt install dosbox-x

Then unzip this zip file to your ~ directory


CONFIGURATION
-------------

To configure the dosbox-x, you can edit the file

    ./dosbox-x.conf


STARTUP
-------

To start this retro programming dosbox: execute (run) the file

    ./dosbox-x.sh

This can be done from the command line interface (terminal) or from the file manager in the graphical user interface.